# WPScan API keys — one per line.
#
# The free WPScan API plan allows 25 requests per key per day. List as many
# keys as you have here and the dashboard will use them in order, rotating to
# the next key automatically when the current one hits its daily limit. A scan
# only fails with a rate-limit error once EVERY key below is exhausted.
#
#   - One key per line.
#   - Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
#   - Get keys from https://wpscan.com/profile (free tier available).
#   - This file is listed in .gitignore so your keys are never committed.
#
# Paste your keys below (remove the leading '#'):
#
# 0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef01
# fedcba9876543210fedcba9876543210fedcba9876543210fe
